---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const changeDetails = [
  { detail: 'Publication Date', why: 'Shows when the notice was first recorded' },
  { detail: 'Last Reviewed Date', why: 'Shows when the information was most recently checked' },
  { detail: 'Status Label', why: 'Shows whether the update is confirmed, under review, active, ended, or archived' },
  { detail: 'Related Updates', why: 'May show a newer notice that replaces an earlier record' },
];

const notProvided = [
  'Account login help',
  'Password recovery',
  'OTP assistance',
  'Payment support',
  'Identity verification help',
  'Private account troubleshooting',
  'Installation files',
  'Personal account review',
];

const lastUpdated = 'June 21, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="All Yono Update Disclaimer: Information Use Notice"
  description="Read the AllYonoUpdate.com disclaimer covering independent update records, dated information, third-party references, and account-safety boundaries."
  rawTitle
  ogTitle="All Yono Update Disclaimer and Information Use Notice"
  ogDescription="Read how AllYonoUpdate.com presents dated update records, independent information, third-party references, and account-safety reminders."
  robots="index, follow"
  keywords={[
    'all yono update disclaimer',
    'all yono information disclaimer',
    'all yono update website disclaimer',
    'all yono independent tracker notice',
    'all yono update records notice',
  ]}
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 pt-16 pb-10 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-primary sm:text-4xl">Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      AllYonoUpdate.com is an independent informational website that records date-stamped updates related to
      All Yono game listings, event notices, promo-code status, app changes, feature updates, and article
      revisions.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      The website is not presented as an operator, representative, customer-support channel, or account service
      for any All Yono application, game platform, or related third party.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      By using this website, you understand that the information published here is provided for general
      reference.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/" class="rounded-md bg-brand-accent/10 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-accent border border-brand-accent/50 transition hover:bg-brand-accent/20">
        Back to Home
      </a>
      <a href="/editorial-policy/" class="rounded-md border border-gray-700 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-300 transition hover:border-gray-500 hover:text-gray-100">
        Read Editorial Policy
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-10 lg:px-8">
    <div class="rounded-lg border border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-500/10 px-6 py-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-primary">No Bank Affiliation</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-200">
        AllYonoUpdate.com is not related or affiliated to Yono SBI or any related bank. "All Yono" game and
        platform names referenced on this website are unrelated third-party products, and any similarity in
        naming is coincidental.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-10 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-primary">Independent Information Website</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      AllYonoUpdate.com publishes update records to help readers follow visible changes over time.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      The website does not claim ownership of, control over, or direct involvement in any application, game
      platform, event, feature, or service mentioned in its content unless clearly stated otherwise.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      References to names, game titles, app features, events, or third-party services are used only to describe
      the topic of an update or informational record.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-10 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-primary">Information Can Change</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      Game listings, app layouts, event timing, promo-code status, features, menu paths, and platform notices
      may change after an update is published. For this reason, readers should review:
    </p>

    <div class="mt-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-gray-800">
      <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
        <thead class="bg-brand-surface/50">
          <tr>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-brand-primary">Detail</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-brand-primary">Why It Matters</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-800">
          {changeDetails.map((row) => (
            <tr>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-gray-200">{row.detail}</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-300">{row.why}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      Older information remains available for context, but it should not be treated as current without checking
      the latest dated update.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-10 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-primary">No Guarantee of Availability or Accuracy</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      AllYonoUpdate.com aims to present clear and organised information, but it cannot guarantee that every game
      listing, event, promo-code notice, feature, menu path, or platform update will remain accurate, available,
      or applicable after publication.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      Information may vary by application version, device, release timing, location, account status, or later
      platform changes.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      Readers should use their own judgment and confirm time-sensitive information through appropriate official
      or verified sources where available.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-10 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-primary">Promo Code and Event Information</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      Promo-code status, event notices, and temporary platform updates may change quickly.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      A listed code, event period, update status, or feature notice may expire, change, or no longer apply after
      the post's publication time. Do not assume that an older notice remains active.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      AllYonoUpdate.com does not promise that any code, event, feature, or listing will be available to every
      user or remain active for a fixed period.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-10 lg:px-8">
    <div class="rounded-lg border border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-500/10 px-6 py-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-primary">No Account or Private Support</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-200">AllYonoUpdate.com does not provide:</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2">
        {notProvided.map((item) => (
          <li class="rounded-md border border-amber-500/30 bg-brand-surface px-4 py-2 text-sm text-gray-200">{item}</li>
        ))}
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-gray-200">
        Never share passwords, OTPs, payment details, identity documents, account numbers, or private
        screenshots through unofficial contact routes.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-200">
        The Contact section is only for public correction requests, editorial feedback, and general website
        questions.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact/" class="mt-4 inline-block rounded-md bg-brand-accent/10 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-accent border border-brand-accent/50 transition hover:bg-brand-accent/20">
        Contact All Yono Update
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-10 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-primary">Third-Party Links and References</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      The website may refer to external websites, platforms, guides, or public information sources when they
      are relevant to a published update.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      External websites operate independently. AllYonoUpdate.com does not control their content, availability,
      policies, security practices, or future changes.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      A link or reference should not be treated as an endorsement, partnership, guarantee, or confirmation that a
      third-party service is suitable for every reader.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-10 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-primary">Update Status Labels</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      AllYonoUpdate.com uses status labels to help readers understand the condition of a notice at the time it
      was recorded. See the Editorial Policy for the full list of labels and what each one means.
    </p>

    <a href="/editorial-policy/" class="mt-4 inline-block rounded-md border border-gray-700 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-300 transition hover:border-gray-500 hover:text-gray-100">
      Read How Updates Are Reviewed
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-10 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-primary">No Professional Advice</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      The content on AllYonoUpdate.com is not legal, financial, technical, security, or professional advice.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      Readers should seek appropriate independent advice when they need help with legal questions, payments,
      account security, device issues, or other matters outside the website's informational role.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-10 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-primary">Changes to This Disclaimer</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      This Disclaimer may be updated when the website structure, content categories, or editorial process
      changes.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      The latest version should remain available on this page with a visible last-updated date.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-gray-400">Last Updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-10 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-primary">Contact and Corrections</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      If you believe a public update record is incomplete, inaccurate, or outdated, you may submit a correction
      request through the Contact section.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-300">
      Please include the relevant update title or URL and a short explanation of the information that needs
      review. Do not submit private account details.
    </p>
    <a href="/contact/" class="mt-4 inline-block rounded-md bg-brand-accent/10 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-accent border border-brand-accent/50 transition hover:bg-brand-accent/20">
      Send Editorial Feedback
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-10 lg:px-8">
    <div class="rounded-lg border border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-500/10 px-6 py-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-primary">Important Reminder</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-200">
        AllYonoUpdate.com is an independent information tracker. Review the status label, publication date, and
        last-reviewed date before relying on any game listing, event notice, promo-code status post, app
        change, or archived update.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
